Viktor 08.10.2026: «НИКОГДА НЕ ЛОМАТЬ СТРОКУ… пройтись по всему коду и вернуть ломанные строки в их текущие autowrap праграфы». The Writer's songwriting instructions (from YuE2 Studio) broke thirteen sentences with a newline in the middle; «Read the complete songwriting instructions» showed them so, and the model read them so. Every other script of the page was looked through for the same: none.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/heresy-assist.js | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

